<title>AUSTRIA: GOVERNMENT LIST (970127).</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST (970127).</headline>
<text>
<p>AUSTRIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970127)</p>
<p>President (Sworn in 8 July 1992</p>
<p>    for 6-year term).............Thomas KLESTIL</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> Chancellor-designate.......Viktor KLIMA (SPOe)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>TWO-PARTY COALITION GOVERNMENT:</p>
<p> Vice-Chancellor......Wolfgang SCHUESSEL (OeVP)</p>
<p>(Also Foreign Minister)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture &amp; Forestry.Wilhelm MOLTERER (OeVP)</p>
<p> Defence...............Werner FASSLABEND (OeVP)</p>
<p> Economics............Johann FARNLEITNER (OeVP)</p>
<p> Education &amp; Culture....Elisabeth GEHRER (OeVP)</p>
<p> Environment..........Martin BARTENSTEIN (OeVP)</p>
<p> Finance..Rudolf EDLINGER (SPOe)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs............See Vice-Chancellor</p>
<p> Health &amp; Social Affairs...Lore HOSTASCH (SPOe)</p>
<p> Interior...Karl SCHLOEGL (SPOe)</p>
