<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>SPOe -- Social Democratic Party</p>
<p>OeVP -- People's Party</p>
<p>			     - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank President........Klaus LIEBSCHER</p>
<p>(National Bank of Austria)</p>
